===========================================
PLACEHOLDER: Custom Header Banner
===========================================

This is a TEXT placeholder file.

INSTRUCTIONS:
-------------
Replace this file with an actual PNG image file 
to display a custom banner at the top of your 
GitHub profile README.

RECOMMENDED SPECIFICATIONS:
---------------------------
- Format: PNG (header.png)
- Dimensions: 1280x320 pixels (or similar wide banner)
- Content: Your name, title, or custom design
- Keep file size reasonable (<500KB recommended)

ALTERNATIVE:
------------
If you don't want a custom header image, you can
simply remove or ignore this file. The README uses
capsule-render for the animated header banner, so
this file is optional.

The capsule-render header will display regardless
of whether you replace this placeholder or not.

